WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.560
MakeInfluencer helps you refresh

00:01.560 --> 00:02.930
your video ads without expensive

00:02.960 --> 00:04.020
reshoots.

00:04.050 --> 00:05.250
Do your Facebook and TikTok

00:05.250 --> 00:06.870
creatives stop working after two

00:06.870 --> 00:07.760
weeks?

00:07.840 --> 00:08.980
And reshooting a video with a

00:08.980 --> 00:11.660
creator is expensive and takes days.

00:11.660 --> 00:13.510
With MakeInfluencer, your product

00:13.510 --> 00:15.840
photo becomes a UGC-style video ad,

00:15.840 --> 00:17.980
presented by an AI presenter, in two

00:17.980 --> 00:19.680
versions ready to test.

00:19.680 --> 00:21.740
You create the presenter once.

00:21.820 --> 00:23.730
It keeps the same face in every ad,

00:23.730 --> 00:24.980
so your brand gets a face your

00:24.980 --> 00:26.600
customers recognize.

00:26.600 --> 00:27.900
Then you generate three different

00:27.900 --> 00:29.790
hooks for the same ad and test them

00:29.790 --> 00:31.420
to see which one stops the scroll

00:31.420 --> 00:32.880
and brings in orders.

00:32.880 --> 00:35.400
Product photo, presenter, video,

00:35.400 --> 00:37.320
three hooks, test.

00:37.340 --> 00:38.680
You refresh your creatives every

00:38.680 --> 00:40.340
week, without a shoot.

00:40.340 --> 00:41.780
Answer two quick questions on this

00:41.780 --> 00:43.540
page to see where to start.
